  "id": "we-stay-looking",
  "title": "We Stay Looking",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "After successfully investigating the disappearance of 26 year-old LaToya Thompson in “Looking For LaToya,” citizen sleuth, Rose Cranberry, is back to take on injustice in our system. Starring Terri J. Vaughn as Rose Cranberry, this satirical \"true crime\" series uses comedy to shed light on systemic issues and racial disparities within the media and the criminal justice system. ‘We Stay Looking’ is a production of Raedio, Tenderfoot TV and HBO, and is adapted from HBO's acclaimed series ‘Insecure’. Stream all seasons of Insecure now on HBO and HBO Max. We are proud to support The Black and Missing Foundation along with other organizations dedicated to seeking justice for the Black community.",
